          <groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type>
          <groundspeak:finder id="25790230">MaybeSunshine</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP597 Bassano [FOUND]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I haven’t gone on too many adventures this year, but with a day off and the weather still sort of okay(ish), it got me out to Dinosaur PP today. I hit this on the way. It remains just the same as in past logs…pretty much impossible to miss or destroy under the valve cover. TFTBC.&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
        <groundspeak:log id="684674205">
          <groundspeak:date>2017-05-06T20:00:00</groundspeak:date>
          <groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type>
          <groundspeak:finder id="3061435">Iron Phoenix</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP597 - Bassano&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Out for another day of capping and caching with OBA, this time we went east!! &lt;img src="/images/icons/icon_smile_big.gif" border="0" align="middle" /&gt; Easy to spot, and easy enough to get the lid off! It might be getting dark outside, but we had to use the flash on our cameras to see the cap way down at the bottom anyways! TFTCap!!&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
